#: ../../tools/nasa_sbdb_tools.rst:75 2d6f5be9a39b45a0b241ac849cfeb677
msgid "**Name**: ``NASASBDB_get_body``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nasa_sbdb_tools.rst:77 e3581413731848aa839f7757b85f06b6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get physical and orbital data for an asteroid, comet, or"
" small solar system body from NASA's Small Body Database (SBDB). Returns "
"object classification (asteroid/comet type), orbital class (NEO, MBA, "
"Centaur, TNO, etc.), physical parameters (magnitude, size estimates), and"
" detailed orbital elements. SBDB catalogs 1.3 million+ small bodies. "
"Search by name (e.g., 'Ceres', 'Halley', 'Apophis'), number (e.g., '433' "
"for Eros), or provisional designation (e.g., '2020 SO')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nasa_sbdb_tools.rst:81 f7db214d977645b2a6e7c1d2c3a27b1a
msgid ""
"``sstr`` (string) (required) Small body identifier: name, number, or "
"designation. Examples: 'Ceres' (1 Ceres), '433' (433 Eros), 'Apophis' "
"(99942 Apophis), 'Bennu' (101955 Bennu), 'Halley' (1P/Halley comet), "
"'2020 SO', '67P' (Churyumov-Gerasimenko)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nasa_sbdb_tools.rst:84 dc035f7f7b8d4fbdb043ae909893770f
msgid ""
"``phys-par`` (string, null) (optional) Whether to include physical "
"parameters: 'true' (default) or 'false'"
msgstr ""

